Pelicanceres is a member of the [[Org/Sedecium|Sedecium]] crew of the [[Geography/Færrin/Infinite Horizon/Far Realms/Hesperid|Hesperid]], one of the three found trapped in a shelter aboard the wreck and freed by the Party.
